    ["<Assistant_Title1>永不谢幕</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>通关乌托邦剧院噩梦难度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Never Curtain Call</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Clear Utopia Theater on Nightmare difficulty",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>夜蓝绒面・星尘披风・魔法制服\n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Night Blue Velvet · Stardust Cape · Magic Uniform\nSome mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<M_Default>「你所宣称的未来，或将上演，成为现实。」</>\n<M_Default>为了更好地为各位非凡者效劳，更好地守护廷根、守护诡秘之主的世界，代号诡秘开发组</><M_Red>#空想家计划#</><M_Default>现向所有非凡者征集你理想中的诡秘之主游戏玩法！</>\n<M_Default>欢迎留下你的创意和意见，世界会将你的想法带给开发组：</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=https://lotm.tzxxx.com/\">代号诡秘官网</>"] = "<M_Default>\"The future you claim may unfold and become reality.\"</>\n<M_Default>To better serve all Beyonders and better guard Tingen and the world of the Lord of Mysteries, the Code: Mysteries development team</><M_Red>#VisionaryProject#</><M_Default>is now collecting the Lord of Mysteries gameplay you envision from all Beyonders!</>\n<M_Default>Welcome to leave your creative ideas and feedback, and the world will bring your thoughts to the development team:</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=https://lotm.tzxxx.com/\">Code: Mysteries Official Website</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n“歌剧魅影”第一场搭配现已开放，剧院静候您的前来。\n周五20:00，演出将准时开启。请您务必留意，在周五19:30前加入一家具有参赛资格的俱乐部，并成为<M_Orange>正式成员</>，完成外观搭配。参与搭配，即可收获馈赠。俱乐部搭配评分<M_Orange>前五名</>将获得登台资格。\n愿您在舞台上如星辰般闪耀，稍后再见！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe first \"Phantom of the Opera\" outfit coordination is now open. The theater awaits your arrival. \nThe performance will start promptly on Friday at 20:00. Please be sure to join a club with participation eligibility before 19:30 on Friday, become an <M_Orange>official member</>, and complete your outfit coordination. Participate in the coordination to receive gifts. The top <M_Orange>five</> clubs in coordination scores will earn the qualification to perform on stage. \nMay you shine like a star on stage, see you later!",
